              "Verify cluster status in web console",
              "Check VPN connection if required",
              "Review firewall rules"
            ],
            "fix": "Restore network connectivity or wait for cluster to be available",
            "prevention": "Verify cluster status before starting tests",
            "documentation": "https://docs.openshift.com/container-platform/latest/support/troubleshooting/troubleshooting-network-issues.html"
          }
